sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant HTML
    participant DeviceConfig as device-config<br/>(UI Component)
    participant Logic as DeviceConfigLogic<br/>(Business Logic)
    participant Auth as authService
    participant Session as userSessionManager
    participant Storage as storageService
    participant MQTT as mqttService
    participant Device as deviceService
    participant Monitor as deviceMonitorService
    participant AI as ollamaAIService
    participant IndexDB as indexedDBService
    participant Firebase as firebaseService
    participant Supabase as supabaseService

    %% ============================================
    %% PHASE 1: APP INITIALIZATION
    %% ============================================

    Note over Browser,Supabase: PHASE 1: APP INITIALIZATION

    Browser->>HTML: Load index.html
    HTML->>HTML: Parse HTML & Load Scripts
    HTML->>DeviceConfig: <device-config> element found

    activate DeviceConfig
    DeviceConfig->>DeviceConfig: constructor()
    DeviceConfig->>DeviceConfig: connectedCallback()

    DeviceConfig->>Logic: new DeviceConfigLogic(callback)
    activate Logic

    DeviceConfig->>Logic: initialize()

    Logic->>Logic: Check isInitialized flag
    alt Not Initialized
        Logic->>Auth: getCurrentUser()
        Auth-->>Logic: User { id, username }

        Logic->>Session: restoreSession()
        activate Session
        Session->>Storage: localStorage.getItem('user_session')
        Storage-->>Session: sessionData | null

        alt Session Exists
            Session-->>Logic: { devices, mqttSettings, usage }
            Logic->>Device: setDevices(session.devices)
            Logic->>Logic: this.devices = devices
            Logic->>Logic: this.mqttSettings = session.mqttSettings
        else No Session
            Logic->>Storage: load(userId)
            Storage-->>Logic: { devices, mqttSettings }
            Logic->>Device: setDevices(devices)
        end
        deactivate Session

        %% Initialize IndexedDB
        Logic->>IndexDB: isEnabled()
        IndexDB-->>Logic: true/false

        alt IndexedDB Enabled
            Logic->>IndexDB: initialize()
            IndexDB->>IndexDB: Open 'TasmotaSensorDB'
            IndexDB-->>Logic: ✅ Ready
        end

        %% Initialize Supabase
        alt Supabase Settings Enabled
            Logic->>Supabase: initialize(config)
            Supabase->>Supabase: createClient(url, key)
            Supabase-->>Logic: { success: true }
        end

        %% Setup Subscriptions
        Logic->>Logic: setupSubscriptions()

        Logic->>MQTT: onStatusChange(callback)
        activate MQTT
        MQTT-->>Logic: unsubscribe function

        Logic->>MQTT: onMessage(callback)
        MQTT-->>Logic: unsubscribe function

        Logic->>Device: subscribe(callback)
        Device-->>Logic: unsubscribe function

        Logic->>Monitor: onDeviceStatusChange(callback)
        Monitor-->>Logic: registered

        Logic->>AI: onConfigChange(callback)
        AI-->>Logic: unsubscribe function

        %% Attempt Auto-Reconnect
        Logic->>Logic: attemptAutoReconnect()

        alt wasConnected = true && host exists
            Logic->>MQTT: getStatus()
            MQTT-->>Logic: 'disconnected'

            Logic->>Logic: handleConnect()
            Logic->>MQTT: connect(mqttSettings)

            MQTT->>MQTT: Create MQTT.js client
            MQTT->>MQTT: client.connect()

            Note over MQTT: WebSocket connecting...<br/>ws://host:port

            MQTT->>MQTT: status = 'connecting'
            MQTT->>Logic: emit('statusChange', 'connecting')
            Logic->>DeviceConfig: onStateChange()
            DeviceConfig->>DeviceConfig: requestUpdate()

            MQTT->>MQTT: client.on('connect')
            MQTT->>MQTT: status = 'connected'
            MQTT->>Logic: emit('statusChange', 'connected')

            Logic->>Logic: handleMqttStatusChange('connected')
            Logic->>Logic: subscribeToAllDevices()

            loop For Each Device
                Logic->>MQTT: subscribeToDevice(device)
                MQTT->>MQTT: subscribe(topic, QoS)

                alt Device Has LWT
                    MQTT->>MQTT: subscribe(lwtTopic)
                end

                alt Device Has Timers
                    MQTT->>MQTT: subscribe(resultTopic)
                    Logic->>Logic: subscribedTopics.add(topic)
                end

                Note over Logic,MQTT: Stagger: 50-200ms delay
            end

            Logic->>Logic: mqttSettings.wasConnected = true
            Logic->>Storage: save(state)
            Logic->>Session: updateSession()

            Logic->>Logic: autoValidateDevices()
            loop For Each Device (staggered)
                Logic->>Logic: handleValidateDevice(deviceId)
                Logic->>MQTT: publish('cmnd/device/STATUS', '0')
                Note over MQTT: Device validation request
            end
        end

        Logic->>Logic: isInitialized = true
        deactivate MQTT
    else Already Initialized
        Logic-->>DeviceConfig: Early return
    end

    Logic-->>DeviceConfig: Initialization complete
    DeviceConfig->>DeviceConfig: Render UI
    deactivate Logic
    deactivate DeviceConfig

    %% ============================================
    %% PHASE 2: MQTT MESSAGE FLOW
    %% ============================================

    Note over Browser,Supabase: PHASE 2: MQTT MESSAGE FLOW

    MQTT->>MQTT: client.on('message', (topic, payload))
    activate MQTT

    MQTT->>MQTT: Parse JSON payload
    MQTT->>Logic: emit('message', {topic, payload})
    activate Logic

    Logic->>Logic: handleMqttMessage({topic, payload})

    alt STATUS Message (Validation)
        Logic->>Device: getDevice(deviceId)
        Device-->>Logic: device
        Logic->>Logic: deviceValidationService.processStatusMessage()
        Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {validationResult})
    end

    Logic->>Logic: Loop through all devices

    alt LWT Message
        Logic->>Logic: isLwtMessage(device, topic)
        Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {isConnected, lwtStatus})
        Logic->>Monitor: setDeviceStatus(deviceId, isOnline)
        Logic->>Supabase: recordDeviceHistory()
        Logic->>AI: feedToAI(device, topic, data)
    else State/Telemetry Message
        Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {lastSeen})
        Logic->>Monitor: markDeviceActivity(device)
    else Switch Message
        Logic->>Logic: parseSwitchState(payload)
        Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {isOn})
        Logic->>Supabase: recordDeviceHistory()
        Logic->>AI: feedToAI()
    else Sensor Message
        Logic->>Logic: parseSensorData(payload, jsonPath)
        Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {sensorData})
        Logic->>IndexDB: storeSensorData(deviceId, data)
        Logic->>AI: feedToAI()
        Logic->>Supabase: queueMqttMessage()
    else Dimmer Message
        Logic->>Logic: Parse dimmer value & power state
        Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {dimmerValue, isOn})
        Logic->>AI: feedToAI()
    else Shutter Message
        Logic->>Logic: Parse shutter position
        Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {shutterPosition})
        Logic->>AI: feedToAI()
    else Timer Status Message
        Logic->>Logic: handleTimerStatusMessage()
        Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {timerConfig})
    end

    Logic->>Session: trackUsage('mqttMessagesProcessed', 1)
    Logic->>Supabase: queueDeviceState(device)

    Logic->>Device: Emit device change event
    Device->>Logic: emit('devicesChanged', devices)

    Logic->>Logic: handleDeviceChanges(devices)
    Logic->>Logic: saveState()
    Logic->>Storage: save({mqttSettings, devices})
    Logic->>Session: updateSession()
    Logic->>Firebase: syncDevices(userId, devices)
    Logic->>DeviceConfig: onStateChange()
    DeviceConfig->>DeviceConfig: requestUpdate()

    deactivate Logic
    deactivate MQTT

    %% ============================================
    %% PHASE 3: USER INTERACTION - Toggle Device
    %% ============================================

    Note over Browser,Supabase: PHASE 3: USER INTERACTION

    Browser->>DeviceConfig: Click "Toggle Switch"
    activate DeviceConfig

    DeviceConfig->>Logic: handleToggleDevice(device)
    activate Logic

    Logic->>Logic: validateToggle()
    Logic->>MQTT: isConnected()
    MQTT-->>Logic: true

    Logic->>MQTT: toggleSwitch(device, !isOn)
    activate MQTT

    MQTT->>MQTT: Build command topic
    Note over MQTT: cmnd/device/POWER1

    MQTT->>MQTT: client.publish(topic, 'ON'/'OFF')
    MQTT-->>Logic: Published
    deactivate MQTT

    Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {isOn: !isOn})
    Device->>Logic: emit('devicesChanged')

    Logic->>DeviceConfig: onStateChange()
    DeviceConfig->>DeviceConfig: requestUpdate()
    DeviceConfig->>Browser: UI updated (optimistic)

    deactivate Logic
    deactivate DeviceConfig

    Note over MQTT: Broker processes command
    Note over MQTT: Device responds via stat/ topic

    MQTT->>Logic: emit('message', {topic: 'stat/device/RESULT'})
    Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {isOn: actual_state})
    Logic->>DeviceConfig: onStateChange()
    DeviceConfig->>Browser: UI updated (confirmed)

    %% ============================================
    %% PHASE 4: ADD NEW DEVICE
    %% ============================================

    Note over Browser,Supabase: PHASE 4: ADD NEW DEVICE

    Browser->>DeviceConfig: Fill form & click "Add Device"
    activate DeviceConfig

    DeviceConfig->>Logic: handleAddDevice()
    activate Logic

    Logic->>Logic: validateDeviceForm()
    Logic->>Logic: validateNewDevice()

    Logic->>Session: canPerformAction('add_device')
    Session-->>Logic: { allowed: true }

    Logic->>Device: createDevice(newDevice)
    Device->>Device: Generate device ID
    Device->>Device: Build MQTT topics
    Device-->>Logic: device object

    Logic->>Device: addDevice(device)
    Device->>Device: devices.push(device)
    Device->>Logic: emit('devicesChanged', devices)

    Logic->>Logic: deviceStatusMap.set(deviceId, isConnected)

    alt MQTT Connected
        Logic->>MQTT: subscribeToDevice(device)
        activate MQTT

        MQTT->>MQTT: subscribe(commandTopic)
        MQTT->>MQTT: subscribe(statTopic)
        MQTT->>MQTT: subscribe(resultTopic)

        alt Device Has LWT
            MQTT->>MQTT: subscribe(lwtTopic)
        end

        MQTT-->>Logic: Subscribed
        deactivate MQTT
    end

    Logic->>Session: updateSession()
    Logic->>Storage: save(state)
    Logic->>Firebase: syncDevices()
    Logic->>Session: checkAndWarnLimits()

    Logic->>Logic: newDevice = DEFAULT_NEW_DEVICE
    Logic->>DeviceConfig: onStateChange()
    DeviceConfig->>Browser: UI updated (form cleared)

    deactivate Logic
    deactivate DeviceConfig

    %% ============================================
    %% PHASE 5: SENSOR DATA LOGGING
    %% ============================================

    Note over Browser,Supabase: PHASE 5: SENSOR DATA LOGGING

    MQTT->>Logic: Sensor message received
    activate Logic

    Logic->>Logic: handleSensorMessage()
    Logic->>Logic: parseSensorData()
    Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {sensorData})

    Logic->>IndexDB: storeSensorData(deviceId, name, topic, data)
    activate IndexDB

    IndexDB->>IndexDB: Open transaction
    IndexDB->>IndexDB: Add record to 'sensor_data' store
    IndexDB->>IndexDB: Check maxRecordsPerDevice

    alt Over Limit
        IndexDB->>IndexDB: Delete oldest records
    end

    IndexDB-->>Logic: Stored
    deactivate IndexDB

    Logic->>Supabase: queueMqttMessage()
    activate Supabase

    Supabase->>Supabase: Add to batch queue

    alt Queue full OR timeout
        Supabase->>Supabase: Flush batch to database
        Supabase->>Supabase: INSERT INTO mqtt_messages
        Supabase-->>Logic: Success
    end
    deactivate Supabase

    Logic->>AI: feedToAI(device, topic, data)
    activate AI

    AI->>AI: processMqttData(context)
    AI->>AI: Add to data buffer

    alt Analysis interval reached
        AI->>AI: analyzeDevices()
        AI->>AI: Call Ollama API
        AI-->>Logic: Analysis complete
    end
    deactivate AI

    Logic->>DeviceConfig: onStateChange()
    DeviceConfig->>Browser: Sensor value updated in UI

    deactivate Logic

    %% ============================================
    %% PHASE 6: RULES ENGINE
    %% ============================================

    Note over Browser,Supabase: PHASE 6: RULES ENGINE

    Browser->>DeviceConfig: Open "Manage Rules"
    DeviceConfig->>Logic: openRuleModal(deviceId)
    Logic->>DeviceConfig: showRuleModal = true
    DeviceConfig->>Browser: <rule-builder-modal> rendered

    Browser->>DeviceConfig: Add rule & save
    DeviceConfig->>Logic: Rule saved to device.ruleConfig
    Logic->>Device: updateDevice(id, {ruleConfig})

    MQTT->>Logic: New message arrives
    Logic->>Logic: handleMqttMessage()
    Logic->>Device: Device updated

    Device->>Device: Rule engine evaluates

    alt Rule condition met
        Device->>Device: Queue rule action
        Device->>Logic: executeRuleAction(device, action)

        Logic->>MQTT: publish(topic, command)
        Note over Logic,MQTT: Execute rule action<br/>(e.g., turn on another device)
    end

    %% ============================================
    %% PHASE 7: DISCONNECT & CLEANUP
    %% ============================================

    Note over Browser,Supabase: PHASE 7: DISCONNECT & CLEANUP

    Browser->>DeviceConfig: Click "Logout"
    activate DeviceConfig

    DeviceConfig->>Logic: handleLogout()
    activate Logic

    Logic->>Storage: save(state)
    Logic->>Logic: cleanup()

    Logic->>Logic: Unsubscribe all observables
    Logic->>Monitor: stopAll()
    Logic->>AI: destroy()
    Logic->>IndexDB: close()

    Note over Logic: ⚠️ MQTT stays connected!<br/>(Prevents reconnection loop)

    Logic->>Auth: logout()
    Auth->>Storage: Remove user session
    Auth->>Browser: Redirect to /login

    deactivate Logic

    Browser->>DeviceConfig: Navigation away
    DeviceConfig->>DeviceConfig: disconnectedCallback()
    DeviceConfig->>Logic: cleanup() [called again]
    Note over DeviceConfig,Logic: Component unmounted<br/>but MQTT persists

    deactivate DeviceConfig

    %% ============================================
    %% PHASE 8: COMPONENT REMOUNT (THE BUG!)
    %% ============================================

    Note over Browser,Supabase: PHASE 8: REMOUNT (BUG SCENARIO)

    Browser->>DeviceConfig: Navigate back to device-config
    activate DeviceConfig

    DeviceConfig->>DeviceConfig: connectedCallback()
    DeviceConfig->>Logic: new DeviceConfigLogic()
    activate Logic

    DeviceConfig->>Logic: initialize()

    Logic->>Logic: Check isInitialized
    Note over Logic: ❌ BUG: Flag was reset<br/>by previous cleanup()

    Logic->>Logic: isInitialized = false
    Logic->>Logic: Run full initialization AGAIN

    Logic->>Logic: setupSubscriptions()
    Logic->>MQTT: onStatusChange() [DUPLICATE!]
    Logic->>MQTT: onMessage() [DUPLICATE!]

    Logic->>Logic: subscribeToAllDevices()

    loop For Each Device
        Logic->>MQTT: subscribeToDevice()
        Note over MQTT: ⚠️ DUPLICATE subscription!<br/>Already subscribed
        MQTT->>MQTT: Topic already in subscriptions
        MQTT->>MQTT: Message handlers stack up
    end

    Note over MQTT,Logic: 🔥 PROBLEM:<br/>Multiple handlers for same topic<br/>Message processing duplicated<br/>Broker sees duplicate subscriptions<br/>Connection becomes unstable

    MQTT->>MQTT: Broker rate-limiting kicks in
    MQTT->>MQTT: Connection drops
    MQTT->>Logic: emit('statusChange', 'disconnected')

    Logic->>Logic: Auto-reconnect triggered
    Note over Logic,MQTT: Reconnection loop begins...

    deactivate Logic
    deactivate DeviceConfig